**Table 3: The correlations between magnitude and breadth.**

| Project | Median Mgn. | Median Brd. | Spearman ρ (α = 0.05) | Trendᵃ |
| :---------: | ----------: | ----------: | ----------------------: | :----: |
| P1 | 11 | 0.933 | +0.054 *(p = 0.11 > α)* | ～～ |
| P2 | 18 | 0.957 | +0.313 *(p ≪ α)* | 〜∿ |
| P3 | 27 | 1.000 | +0.092 *(p < α)* | —— |
